# Vue Structure

## Folders

- Pages: `src/views/*View.vue`
- Shell: `src/layouts/` (e.g. `MainLayout.vue`)
- Home sections: `src/components/home/`
- Shared chrome: `src/components/AppHeader.vue`, `AppFooter.vue`
- Logic: `src/composables/use*.js`
- HTTP helper: `src/services/`
- Import alias: `@` → `src`

## Naming

- SFCs: PascalCase (`HeroSection.vue`)
- Route names: kebab-case (`home`, `not-found`)
- Composables: `useSomething.js`

## State

- No global store yet — theme/locale via composables + `localStorage`
- Keep section components presentational; put reusable behavior in composables

## New pages

1. Add `views/FooView.vue`
2. Register under `MainLayout` children in `src/router/index.js`
3. Add matching locale files under `src/locales/{ar,en}/`
